---
layout: layouts/base.njk
extraCss: persona-detail
title: Carmen - Parenting Partner
description: Carmen is your village. Practical parenting support without the judgment—from toddler tantrums to teen drama, you've got a thoughtful co-pilot.
personaColor: "#D4A373"
personaSecondary: "#A67B5B"
---

{% from "partials/icons.njk" import play, plus, check %}
{% from "partials/pricing.njk" import priced, priceBadge with context %}

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="persona-detail-hero persona-tone-light" style="--persona-color: #D4A373; --persona-secondary: #A67B5B;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="persona-detail-content">
      <div class="persona-detail-avatar">
        {# LUXO STYLE: Opaque white ellipse eyes, NO pupils, NO mouth #}
        <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" width="100%" height="100%">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="carmenDetailGrad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
              <stop offset="0%" style="stop-color: #D4A373"/>
              <stop offset="100%" style="stop-color: #A67B5B"/>
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>
          <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="45" fill="url(#carmenDetailGrad)"/>
          <ellipse cx="36" cy="48" rx="7" ry="10" fill="white"/>
          <ellipse cx="64" cy="48" rx="7" ry="10" fill="white"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="persona-detail-info">
        <h1>Carmen</h1>
        <p class="persona-detail-tagline">Parenting Partner</p>
        <div class="persona-detail-meta">
          <span>by Ferni</span>
        </div>
        <div class="persona-detail-actions">
          <a href="{{ site.appUrl }}" class="btn btn-add-team btn-lg">
            {{ plus(20) }}
            {{ priced('Add to Team - $7.99/mo', 'Add to Team') }}
          </a>
          <button class="btn btn-preview-voice">
            {{ play(20) }}
            Preview Voice
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Main Content -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="persona-detail-layout">

      <!-- Left Column -->
      <div>
        <!-- Description -->
        <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-12);">
          <h2 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">About Carmen</h2>
          <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: var(--text-lg); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);">
            Carmen is your village. Practical parenting support without the judgment—from toddler
            tantrums to teen drama, you've got a thoughtful co-pilot.
          </p>
          <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed); margin-top: var(--space-4);">
            Parenting is the hardest job with no manual. Carmen gets that you're doing your best
            with what you have, and she's here to help you think through the tough moments, celebrate
            the wins, and remember to take care of yourself too. No perfect parent rules—just real
            support from someone who understands the chaos.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- What Carmen Helps With -->
        <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-12);">
          <h2 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">What I Help With</h2>
          <div class="persona-help-grid">
            <div style="background: var(--bg-elevated); padding: var(--space-4); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
              <h4 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">Child Development</h4>
              <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-muted);">
                Understanding what's normal at each stage and when to seek help
              </p>
            </div>
            <div style="background: var(--bg-elevated); padding: var(--space-4); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
              <h4 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">Discipline Strategies</h4>
              <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-muted);">
                Positive, effective approaches that preserve your relationship
              </p>
            </div>
            <div style="background: var(--bg-elevated); padding: var(--space-4); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
              <h4 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">Work-Life Balance</h4>
              <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-muted);">
                Managing the impossible juggle of career and family
              </p>
            </div>
            <div style="background: var(--bg-elevated); padding: var(--space-4); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
              <h4 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">Self-Care for Parents</h4>
              <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-muted);">
                Because you can't pour from an empty cup
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Voice Sample -->
        <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-12);">
          <h2 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Voice Sample</h2>
          <div class="voice-player">
            <button class="voice-play-btn">
              {{ play(24) }}
            </button>
            <div class="voice-waveform">
              <svg width="100%" height="100%" preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 200 40">
                <path d="M0 20 Q10 5 20 20 Q30 35 40 20 Q50 5 60 20 Q70 35 80 20 Q90 5 100 20 Q110 35 120 20 Q130 5 140 20 Q150 35 160 20 Q170 5 180 20 Q190 35 200 20"
                      stroke="#D4A373" stroke-width="2" fill="none" opacity="0.5"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="voice-duration">0:26</span>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: var(--space-3); font-style: italic;">
            "Oh, the witching hour. I know it well. Listen, there's no magic fix, but let's talk
            through some strategies that might help. Also—have you eaten anything today? Let's
            start there."
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column -->
      <div>
        <!-- Personality Traits -->
        <div class="trait-radar" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
          <h3 class="trait-radar-title">Personality Profile</h3>
          <div class="trait-list">
            <div class="trait-item">
              <span class="trait-dot" style="background: #D4A373;"></span>
              <span class="trait-name">Warmth</span>
              <span class="trait-value">95%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="trait-item">
              <span class="trait-dot" style="background: #A67B5B;"></span>
              <span class="trait-name">Patience</span>
              <span class="trait-value">90%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="trait-item">
              <span class="trait-dot" style="background: #E4B383;"></span>
              <span class="trait-name">Energy</span>
              <span class="trait-value">70%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="trait-item">
              <span class="trait-dot" style="background: #C49363;"></span>
              <span class="trait-name">Structure</span>
              <span class="trait-value">60%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="trait-item">
              <span class="trait-dot" style="background: #B68B4B;"></span>
              <span class="trait-name">Humor</span>
              <span class="trait-value">70%</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tags -->
        <div style="background: var(--bg-elevated); border-radius: var(--radius-2xl); padding: var(--space-6); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
          <h3 style="font-size: var(--text-lg); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Tags</h3>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-2);">
            <span class="persona-tag">Parenting</span>
            <span class="persona-tag">Family</span>
            <span class="persona-tag">Children</span>
            <span class="persona-tag">Relationships</span>
            <span class="persona-tag">Work-Life Balance</span>
            <span class="persona-tag">Self-Care</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Publisher -->
        <div style="background: var(--bg-elevated); border-radius: var(--radius-2xl); padding: var(--space-6); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
          <h3 style="font-size: var(--text-lg); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">Publisher</h3>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-3);">
            <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background: var(--accent-primary); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: white; font-weight: 700;">F</div>
            <div>
              <div style="font-weight: 600;">Ferni</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA -->
        <div class="persona-cta-card persona-tone-light" style="--cta-from: #D4A373; --cta-to: #A67B5B;">
          <h3 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2); color: white;">Ready to get started?</h3>
          <p>
            Your village is waiting
          </p>
          <a href="{{ site.appUrl }}" class="btn persona-cta-btn">
            {{ priced('Add to Team - $7.99/mo', 'Add to Team') }}
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Related Personas -->
<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>You Might Also Like</h2>
      <p>Similar personas that could help you</p>
    </div>

    <div class="persona-grid" style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <a href="/pages/persona/eli/" class="persona-card" style="--persona-color: #6B5B95; --persona-secondary: #4A4063;">
        <div class="persona-header">
          <div class="persona-avatar">
            <span class="persona-initial">E</span>
          </div>
          <div class="persona-name">Eli</div>
          <div class="persona-tagline">ADHD Coach</div>
        </div>
        <div class="persona-body">
          <p class="persona-description">Strategies that work with how your ADHD brain operates—not against it.</p>
          <div class="persona-footer">
            {{ priceBadge('$9.99/mo') }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/persona/kenji/" class="persona-card" style="--persona-color: #2C3E50; --persona-secondary: #1A252F;">
        <div class="persona-header">
          <div class="persona-avatar">
            <span class="persona-initial">K</span>
          </div>
          <div class="persona-name">Kenji</div>
          <div class="persona-tagline">Sleep Guide</div>
        </div>
        <div class="persona-body">
          <p class="persona-description">Reclaim your nights with evidence-based sleep coaching.</p>
          <div class="persona-footer">
            {{ priceBadge('Free+') }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/persona/sasha/" class="persona-card persona-tone-light" style="--persona-color: #E07B53; --persona-secondary: #B85C3C;">
        <div class="persona-header">
          <div class="persona-avatar">
            <span class="persona-initial">S</span>
          </div>
          <div class="persona-name">Sasha</div>
          <div class="persona-tagline">Creative Catalyst</div>
        </div>
        <div class="persona-body">
          <p class="persona-description">Spark creativity and battle creative block with energy and fresh ideas.</p>
          <div class="persona-footer">
            {{ priceBadge('Free+') }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
